1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
dworker
Spare GPU compute, on your terms

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
See this host's GPU and advertised model packs.
Check which workloads it can serve

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Eligible routes are listed per workload —
with the reason when this machine can't run one

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
You choose what to advertise.
Here we enable the image-generate route

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Toggles re-register live with the controller;
nothing claims work you didn't allow

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Pause new claims any time —
the worker stops picking up work

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Pausing does not interrupt an active job.
Resume to rejoin the queue

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:43,000
An image-generate job is claimed: the trusted
executor runs it on the local GPU

9
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:50,000
The finished PNG streams back to the
controller, content-addressed and validated

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:00,000
